     1	# NeuroBuilder
     2	
     3	> **A visual playground for rapid neural network experimentation.**  
     4	> Design, train, and analyze deep learning models through an intuitive GUI without writing PyTorch code.
     5	
     6	### Live Demo
     7	
     8	**https://neurobuilder.jainilpatel.dev**
     9	
    10	---
    11	
    12	## Overview
    13	
    14	NeuroBuilder is a full-stack application built for students, researchers, and ML practitioners who want to **quickly experiment with neural network architectures**.
    15	
    16	Instead of manually editing Python scripts every time you want to change the number of layers, neurons, activation functions, or optimizers, NeuroBuilder provides a visual interface where you can build a network, configure its training parameters, and observe the training process in real time.
    17	
    18	It enables rapid experimentation with different model designs, making it easier to understand how architectural and hyperparameter choices affect model performance.
    19	
